{"id":2195,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><p>夏日昂扬，活力满场。5月23日，中北大学教职工运动会火热开赛。开幕式上，航空宇航学院教职工方阵担任彩旗队，手持彩旗，步伐铿锵，高喊“赓续兵工，逐梦空天，航空宇航，再创辉煌”的口号昂首入场，成为赛场上一道亮丽的风景线。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=QM7Cq8L8VfnzARUpzfkUlV2MmlsMlVvfMzV7MRvio7QkM7C0gihFp2hmCIa0LSyanSyiUShfUzGDUmQRL4UDoRrRolWfol-sMmTVnNlYMlnFMmVfMNL4U4rFM4-PnRUJqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47aMzlsgtA8pU6cc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=10557&e=.jpg\" draggable=\"false\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/10E5AAA06B6C34685C9BA9B769EFE25D/61A6C3C5/721D4\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"400px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=QozWq2ozQkUmnkoplQ7nz9iL8rfMzvv4nN78M8l8nNCsLN70gihFp2hmCIa0oSybnShVokhRUzffMRTfLzWVLl-4M8LPnRNZM7QfU462UmrFollsL8UZMlrFozWVU8Q7gtXaQ4Oeo4xwqsAbgDTJQty0LzGPLSyPLRliMYbw6268c&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=10557&e=.jpg\"><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=QUmTqfL4rfnlM7MpNLZnl-PLlV2UmVvkL7Vfoz7YLmn2Um70gihFp2hmCIa0n1yZLYhfL1h2nmfkUz9bUmLYnmUiM8rkL7laM8LsUzN4MNQFnzUsUzQRUlVFM8CbLR-Jqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47aMzlsgtA8pU6cc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=10557&e=.jpg\" draggable=\"false\" vspace=\"0\" hspace=\"0\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/F83A2FF0BA89B32F457EB0E07C7A936F/E47A6CAA/7F902\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=QozUq8ozLaollsUpllZM8C4nz7bLNQvVLzGsM874ozW2LRC0gihFp2hmCIa0nSh7LYy4nkhfM4TRM4AVUmQVnlrVol74MlU8MNUYMNQ7MRTFnNLiM7lYMNQFol-aM7rfgtXaQ4Oeo4xwqsAbgDTJQty0LzGPLSyPLRliMYbw6268c&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=10557&e=.jpg\"></p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 赛场上，老师们奋勇争先、默契协作，在短跑竞速、趣味接力、沙包掷准、团体协作等多项赛事中全力以赴、奋勇角逐。青年教师朝气蓬勃、冲刺在前；中年教师沉稳干练、配合默契。赛场内外掌声不断、喝彩连连。大家抛开工作忙碌，在运动中舒展身心、增进交流，在协作中凝聚合力、收获快乐，充分彰显航空宇航人团结友爱、自强不息、勇争一流的精神底色。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=QLmlqaozAkM4GDMpRUanzNsL7LiM7VvkLmTknNnkMRl4Umv0gihFp2hmCIa0okyYL1yYLkhVM4v8LRLZo7LPMlUPM4W7UzV7Ul-8UzW7nlnFMmvbUmGYoRMFMmQfozUJqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47aMzlsgtA8pU6cc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=10557&e=.jpg\" draggable=\"false\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/82220E7740388C15D172